From bb7a093bad551e5ed37de5b34fe0fd562d7d3044 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Geljic <5978447+Geljic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:15:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add a platform switch and strict chunk checking to the
 decoder

ctx.platform() in the schema DSL emits viciousPlatform (0 = Xbox, 1 = PS2),
set from VICIOUS_PLATFORM by stdDecoder(). The decoder calls optional
enterChunk/exitChunk hooks; StdDecoder uses them for a chunk stack and,
with stdDecoderStrict(), checks every chunk ends exactly at its end offset.
A full arena falls back to the heap instead of returning NULL.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
